-- Migration: V10 — Starting squads for the four seeded HNL teams.
-- Description: Lets staff pick lineups by clicking instead of typing every player. A team gets its
--              squad only if it exists and has no players yet, so squads already entered by hand are
--              never touched. 18 players per team (2 goalkeepers, 6 defenders, 5 midfielders, 5 forwards);
--              sample data that the admin can edit from the team page.
